09/28/26|09/28/26||PDT|0|F|Y|Niland|CA|33.2136|-115.5444|PM10|54|Moderate|No|Today, partly to mostly cloudy skies and scattered showers and thunderstorms will hinder ozone formation. However, outflow winds from thunderstorm activity may generate isolated areas of blowing dust, yielding low-Moderate AQI levels for PM10.   Tomorrow, as a weak surface cold front departs to the southeast, moderate and gusty north-northwesterly winds will develop in the Imperial Valley, producing blowing dust. As a result, AQI levels will remain Moderate for PM10.|Imperial County Air Pollution Control District
